    <div class="container site-container">
        <div class="row gy-5">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Transactional Due Diligence Services</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Structured due diligence for investment and transaction readiness</h2>
                <p class="lead-copy">We conduct comprehensive secretarial due diligence to support capital market and investment transactions in compliance with the Companies Act, SEBI regulations and other applicable laws.</p>
                <p>Our team reviews statutory records, governance practices, disclosures and regulatory compliances to identify risks early and support informed transaction decisions.</p>

                <div class="service-detail-points">
                    <h3>Our support includes</h3>
                    <div class="service-detail-list">
                        <article><span>01</span><div><h3>IPO (Pre-DRHP) Due Diligence</h3><p>Assisting Book Running Lead Managers (BRLMs) by carrying out detailed company due diligence, verifying statutory records, corporate governance practices and compliance with SEBI (ICDR) requirements prior to DRHP filing.</p></div></article>
                        <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Private Equity and Investor Due Diligence</h3><p>Preparing secretarial due diligence reports for prospective investors, covering shareholding, statutory filings, contractual obligations and potential compliance risks.</p></div></article>
                        <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Transaction-Based Due Diligence</h3><p>Supporting mergers, acquisitions, rights issues, preferential issues and other corporate actions with compliance verification and documentation review.</p></div></article>
                        <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Secretarial Certifications and Reports</h3><p>Issuing professional certifications, comfort letters and reports required by BRLMs, investors, regulators and other stakeholders.</p></div></article>
                        <article><span>05</span><div><h3>Compliance Gap Identification and Transaction Readiness</h3><p>Providing early visibility into compliance gaps to help ensure transactions are executed smoothly, transparently and in line with regulatory expectations.</p></div></article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
